flowchart TD
    A["Current request: discussion URLs and selected cohorts"] --> B["Preflight: source identity, permissions and checkpoint"]
    B --> C{"Browser action clearly read-only?"}
    C -->|No or uncertain| X["L3: stop unsafe action; suspected mutation stops all browser use; disclose, no undo"]
    C -->|Yes| D["Expand and capture all pages, roots and replies; checkpoint evidence"]
    D --> E{"Source coverage, identity and reconciliation verified?"}
    E -->|No| R["Host-model recovery: preserve evidence, classify risk, bounded safe retry"]
    E -->|Yes| F["Validate capture and export only selected cohorts into a fresh directory"]
    F -->|Export failed| R
    F -->|Export succeeded| G{"Readback, visual review and source checks passed?"}
    G -->|No| R
    G -->|Yes| H["Deliver per-cohort files, counts and limitations; no grading or upload"]
    R -->|Safe source retry| C
    R -->|Verified local input; export repair| F
    R -->|L2: missing source or decision| U["Pause affected scope and ask; independent cohorts may continue"]
    R -->|L3: unsafe| X
    I["Interruption or model handoff"] --> J["Verify local checkpoint hashes, current scope and source freshness; invalidate dependent stages"]
    J -->|Source recheck needed| C
    J -->|Verified export inputs| F
    J -->|Evidence unavailable| U
    H --> K["Complete only when every requested cohort passed; otherwise partial or blocked"]
